 .../test_kanban_sync_hub_keepalive.py         | 293 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 427 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_sync_hub_keepalive.py

